#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Sensor pada titik tumit, metatarsal & jari kaki mendeteksi tekanan berlebih yang berisiko memicu luka."
msgstr "Sensors at the heel, metatarsal, and toe detect excess pressure that risks triggering a wound."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Deteksi Selisih Suhu Kaki"
msgstr "Foot Temperature Spread Detection"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Selisih suhu antar area adalah salah satu prediktor dini peradangan sebelum luka terlihat kasat mata."
msgstr "The temperature spread between areas is one of the earliest predictors of inflammation, before a wound is visible."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Kelembapan Dalam Sepatu"
msgstr "In-Shoe Humidity"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Kelembapan berlebih meningkatkan risiko maserasi & infeksi jamur pada kulit yang sudah rentan."
msgstr "Excess humidity raises the risk of maceration and fungal infection on already vulnerable skin."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Aktivitas & Pola Gerak"
msgstr "Activity & Movement Patterns"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Rekam jumlah langkah dan waktu aktif harian untuk memahami beban yang diterima kaki sepanjang hari."
msgstr "Record daily step count and active time to understand the load your feet carry through the day."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Dashboard Real-time"
msgstr "Real-Time Dashboard"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Semua data sensor tersaji dalam satu dashboard yang mudah dibaca, kapan saja dan di mana saja."
msgstr "All sensor data in one easy-to-read dashboard, any time and anywhere."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Export Laporan Medis"
msgstr "Medical Report Export"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Unduh riwayat data dalam format CSV atau PDF untuk dibawa ke konsultasi dengan dokter."
msgstr "Download your data history as CSV or PDF to bring to a consultation with your doctor."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Selisih suhu di atas ambang ini dikenal dalam literatur kaki diabetik sebagai penanda pre-ulkus — sering muncul sebelum luka terlihat."
msgstr "A temperature spread above this threshold is known in the diabetic foot literature as a pre-ulcer marker — it often appears before a wound is visible."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Batas tekanan plantar"
msgstr "Plantar pressure limit"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Di bawah 200 kPa ditandai aman, 200–250 kPa perlu perhatian, di atas 250 kPa ditandai sebagai risiko ulkus pada dashboard."
msgstr "Below 200 kPa is marked safe, 200–250 kPa needs attention, and above 250 kPa is marked as ulcer risk on the dashboard."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Batas kelembapan sepatu"
msgstr "In-shoe humidity limit"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Kelembapan di atas ambang ini meningkatkan risiko maserasi kulit dan infeksi jamur pada kaki yang sudah rentan."
msgstr "Humidity above this threshold raises the risk of skin maceration and fungal infection on already vulnerable feet."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Pakai Sepatu Glykos"
msgstr "Wear the Glykos Shoe"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Pakai seperti sepatu biasa — insole bersensor sudah terpasang di dalamnya, tidak ada yang perlu dirakit sendiri."
msgstr "Wear it like an ordinary shoe — the sensor insole is already fitted inside, with nothing for you to assemble."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Sensor Merekam Kondisi Kaki"
msgstr "Sensors Record Your Foot Condition"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Tekanan, suhu, kelembapan & aktivitas terekam otomatis dan dikirim ke ponsel lewat Bluetooth."
msgstr "Pressure, temperature, humidity, and activity are recorded automatically and sent to your phone over Bluetooth."

