msgstr "Three Steps to Monitored Feet"

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Dari memakai sepatunya sampai membaca hasilnya di dashboard."
msgstr "From putting the shoes on to reading the results on the dashboard."

#: src/pages/LandingPage.jsx
msgid "Gulir untuk memisahkan ketiga bagiannya: badan sepatu, insole bersensor dengan tiga titik tekanan, dan modul sensor di sisi luar."
msgstr "Scroll to separate the three parts: the shoe body, the sensor insole with three pressure points, and the sensor module on the outer side."

